      "message": "If I get it right, `mFunctions.IsAtLeastGLES(3, 1)` will return true iif **using OpenGLES instead of OpenGL desktop** [1] and version \u003e GLES3.1.\n\nShould we also enable this feature on desktop OpenGL, since it is supported since OpenGL 3.3 [2]? Maybe something like\n```\nif (mFunctions.IsAtLeastGLES(3, 1) || mFunctions.IsAtLeastGL(3, 3)) {\n    EnableFeature(Feature::TextureComponentSwizzle);\n}\n```\n\nBy the way, [2] said OpenGL ES 3.0 supports texture swizzle?\n\n[1]: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/opengl/OpenGLFunctions.cpp;l\u003d61\n[2]: https://www.g-truc.net/post-0734.html",
      "revId": "bc29221e53722fd7f1826cbfe103593b80915f88",
